# ONE train of 2 gt pulses, the same on both edges (every piston a toggle: spit when touching,
# reach-pull across a gap). Open: P_T pulls TM up, the slime drags it to (0,3) (and G along),
# the top elevator (M lowers P_T, P_T pulls C, M lifts P_T, P_T pulls C) brings C into (1,3),
# Qv pulls BM into (1,-1), A pulls BR into (2,-1), K pushes BR BM west, the bottom elevator
# (B lifts A, A pulls MR, B lowers A, A pulls MR) brings MR into (2,-1), P_TR pulls TR up.
# Close, the same pulses: P_T spits C, the slime returns (TM into (1,3), G home), M and P_T push
# the centre down, Qv pushes it back up, G pushes BM east, A spits MR, K pulls BM into (2,-1),
# B and A push the right column up, P_TR pushes it down into place.
